                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Same freedom as today: every hour, minutes in steps of 5, and any minute you type (9:42 adds 42 to the dial). Scroll or use arrow keys to turn each column; the picked time sits in the soft indigo band. Each change applies straight away; Done just closes. A 24-hour business sees 0–23 and no AM/PM.",
