                  "content": "Split one record's content into groups opened one at a time (client page, reviews, marketing, form builder). Never for moving between pages. A tab can carry a small count or amount; money that came in shows green. Two sizes today: page tabs (16) and tabs inside a card (14). Both stay.",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
