                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every amount someone types: payments, deposits, refunds, expenses, discounts, unit prices, price-book items. Typing is free; when you leave the box a good amount is kept with two decimals and a bad one snaps back to the last good amount. Today it shows a plain \"0.00\" and puts the currency in the label (\"Total (USD)\").",
