                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zKryv",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 960,
                  "content": "Main column of cards and a 336 side column, 24 apart, on the warm page — as on Job details. A record split into groups (Client: Details and Communication) carries its page tabs on a full-width band along the foot of its header card; the open tab's cards follow below.",
