                  "width": 1200,
                  "content": "Quote-only lines from today: a heading, a text note, and optional add-ons (recommended or not) that the client may tick when approving. Add-ons are not in the subtotal until chosen, so Jobber greys their money. Once the quote is sent the block is locked, and the foot says what the client's copy shows.",
