              "type": "text",
              "id": "vBahy",
              "name": "Lead",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1400,
              "content": "Approved 2026-10-20: B · Split screen. Sign in, Join the Uplift team, Forgot your password and Choose a new password, with their messages. The left half is the deep-green Uplift panel (mark, Uplift team pill, “The control room”), the same on every screen; the right half is plain white with the form on its own. Same fields, words and buttons as today. Finished messages get a green tile, expired ones a yellow tile.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-large",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
