                  "width": 1400,
                  "content": "A new concept: the screen splits in two. The left half is the deep-green Uplift panel (the one feature card on this screen) with the mark, “Uplift team” and the control room name; it stays the same on every sign-in screen. The right half is plain white with the form on its own, no card around it, like Stripe and Linear sign-in pages.",
