      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Uzj2F",
          "name": "Intro",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qHi6O",
              "name": "Eyebrow",
              "fill": "$color-interactive",
              "content": "NEW CONCEPT · BATCH 24 · DISCOUNT, TAX AND TOTALS · APPROVED BY JAFAR 2026-10-20",
              "lineHeight": 1.3,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-small",
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "O1XBn",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$color-heading",
              "content": "Discount, tax and totals · approved",
              "lineHeight": 1.21,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-jumbo",
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": -0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kV6MZ",
              "name": "Lead",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Approved 2026-10-20: A, refined rows. layout/RailRow, work/RecordDiscountCard, work/RecordTaxCard (the Discount and tax card and its two pop-ups) and quotes/QuoteSummaryCard (the totals card on New quote and New invoice). Each setting is one row: grey tile, label over value, amount at the right, pencil to change it. The total sits in a pink band (blue on an invoice); the owner's cost, profit and margin sit in a grey team-only panel. The New quote form uses the same single Discount and tax card as the quote page. Behaviour unchanged. Option B (money tiles and the green total card) was not chosen.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
