              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "forms/PublicFormQuestion · one question the business wrote, as a customer answers it: on the public request form and in the review feedback journey. Eight kinds: short text, long text, number, dropdown, tick several, pick one, yes / no, and photos (the page draws its own upload box, already approved). Same kinds, same words, same required star and help line; only the look changes. The form makes a request, so the accent is orange.",
