              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "imports/ImportStepper, ImportUploadStep, ImportMapStep, ImportReviewStep · the wizard that brings a client list (also the Price book and opening balances) in from a CSV file. Same four steps, same choices, same words and rules as today: pick a file and how to treat clients you already have, match each column to a field (or don't import it, or don't overwrite it), review what will happen, then import. Nothing is saved until the last step and nothing is sent. Shown for clients, so the accent is the client colour. The Done step is a separate piece and comes later.",
