              "width": 1400,
              "content": "jafar/booking/BookingFrame, BookingMonth, BookingTimePicker, BookingFacts, BookingStatus, BookingBackButton · the public page a business owner opens from your link (/book/discovery-call) to book a sales call. Restyle only: the same three steps (pick a day and time, your details, booked or request sent), the same fields, words, time-zone change and rules as today. Open days stand out, other days are quiet; the times are in the visitor's own zone. Booking is about time, so its tiles use the Time colour; the main button stays brand green.",
