              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "One number card behind every list's numbers, money included. A 48 icon tile (24 icon) on the left; beside it the big number with its short label right under it; the explaining line alone on a grey band at the bottom; a small arrow in the top corner. Cards sit straight on the page in one row: each page shows its own fixed set (Clients 4, Quotes 5, Invoices 5, Requests 6, Jobs 6, Reviews 4). Picking a card filters the list; the picked card has a green ring; an act-now card with a count turns red. The money card is the same card in green and a little wider so the amount fits.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
