    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "vIjf0",
      "x": 23956,
      "y": 5988,
      "name": "Concept · Batch 35 · Shared money summary card · Approved B · 2026-10-21",
      "fill": "$color-surface-background",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 40,
      "padding": 48,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Je6re",
          "name": "Board header",
          "width": 1512,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jc5lx",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$color-heading",
              "content": "Batch 35 · Shared money summary card · Approved B · 2026-10-21",
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-display",
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": -0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LwQCD",
              "name": "Intro",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1512,
              "content": "Approved by Jafar 2026-10-21: one card on the right rail of every job, quote and invoice. The frame stays the same; the title, big number, bar and rows answer the record's question. Job: am I making money, and is it slipping as time and expenses come in? Quote: is this price right before I send it? Invoice: how much will I collect, and when? Followed Jobber (profit bar from line cost + labour + expenses, minimum-profit warning, deposits applied to the invoice), Buildertrend (projected profit; invoiced vs left to invoice) and Stripe (amount due after credits). Colours: each cost its own bright colour, profit green, loss red, amber only for the below-target warning.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "xD1F8",
          "name": "Colour key",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "children": [
