                      "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "New concept, like a parcel tracker: each running follow-up opens with a tinted panel in its status colour that answers 'when does the customer hear from us next?' in big type, a little trail of messages sent, and Pause, Skip and Stop as visible buttons (HubSpot's enrolled notice). When paused, Resume becomes the green button. Finished and stopped follow-ups shrink to one line each under EARLIER.",
