              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "layout/NotificationBell — the pop-up under the top bar's bell. One look serves the team bell (team/TeamNotificationBell: new website inquiries, customer replies, quote decisions, online payments, schedule changes, messages, feedback) and Jafar's bell (jafar/NotificationBell, which adds \"View all\" at the foot). Same behaviour as live: newest first, title, up to two lines of detail and the time; unread is bold with a dot; an alert that needs a look keeps its orange or red dot; Mark all read (with loading); clicking an alert opens its record. New look, following Linear, Atlassian and SaaS notification-centre guidance: a coloured tile tells you what the alert is about before you read it (inquiry orange, quote pink, invoice blue, inbox teal, schedule indigo, review olive), and alerts are split by day. The bell button itself is the approved top bar one (8px red dot).",
