                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o6vjt",
                      "name": "Option description",
                      "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Large pop-up (940). Rescheduling is why this pop-up opens most, so the time gets its own blue panel at the left: a big date card that reads back the day and hours as you change them, then one three-way switch — Set a time · Anytime · Later — in place of the Anytime and Schedule later ticks (the same two settings, but they can never be ticked together by mistake). The visit's details sit at the right; Notify customer moves into the footer beside the buttons.",
