              "content": "Approved A by Jafar 2026-10-22; option B (reasons as tiles, a What happens checklist) deleted. pipeline/MarkOpportunityLostDialog, a form pop-up with two jobs. (1) Mark as lost, from a Pipeline card's menu: it takes the request or quote off the board and archives it (a request's open tasks are marked complete; a quote's tasks are removed and the amount the customer last saw is kept as the lost value). (2) Lost reason, from Pipeline → Outcomes on something already lost: only the reason and note change, and a customer's own decline words show above the form. Same fields as the live app: Reason (optional) from the business's own list (7 built in, up to 25; “Other” needs a note), Note (up to 1,000 characters), Cancel and the action.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
