              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Every white button (secondary, More menu, icon, pencil, danger, and joined groups like ‹ Today › and Map | Filters) is a white key lifted off the surface by a soft ring of shadow, with a whisper of top-to-bottom shading. In dark mode the key is a slightly lighter colour with a faint top highlight. Green is kept for the main button and for a switched-on button, which keeps its green edge and green label on the key. Quiet buttons, the solid red confirm button, field boxes and filter chips are unchanged. Option A (soft grey edge) was not chosen and has been removed.",
