              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "A contractor opens Settings to change one thing or to check the business is ready for customers. The control room answers most questions without opening anything: the business card on top, the green Ready for customers card with what is left, the texting & email balance with Request top-up, then one card per area whose rows show each setting's current value (amber when it waits on you), and a slim Your account strip. Groups follow Jobber, Housecall Pro and ServiceTitan: Your business, Talking to customers, Work, Growth, Team, Your account. Option B (search first) was not chosen and has been removed.",
