            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CEgEt",
              "name": "Option note",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Opens like a small welcome screen: a tall brand-colour top with the logo and a big friendly question, and one white card that asks for the message first, then how to reply. Contact details sit together in one tidy box. A 'Message us' pill button replaces the round button, so visitors know what it does.",
