              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1400,
              "content": "Approved B by Jafar 2026-10-22, with option A’s number list in step 2 (no cards/list switch); option A deleted. New: Settings → Communications → Text messages gets an “Add number” button (today the Phone numbers card says “Contact Jafar to request one”). Researched from GoHighLevel’s Add Number (country → filters for number type, Text/Pictures/Calls and digits → pick a number to see its abilities, type, paperwork need and monthly price → Proceed to Buy → paperwork if needed) and Twilio’s Buy a number. Rules from the approved plan: only numbers that can text are shown; the final selling price and any setup charge show before buying; owning a number is not the same as being ready to text; a country that needs paperwork asks for approved paperwork first. Prices on this board are examples; the real ones are Jafar’s selling prices.",
