              "type": "text",
              "id": "vn1he",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "The one thing that needs you sits at the top (the UK set needs a fix, with the phone company's reason in plain words). Each row says what the set is for, where it stands and what happens next. At the right: how paperwork works, and the business details it reuses.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
