          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qKcT9",
              "name": "Eyebrow",
              "fill": "$color-interactive",
              "content": "COMMUNICATIONS · STAGE 10 · NUMBER READINESS · APPROVED B BY JAFAR · 2026-10-22",
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-overline",
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Tmmb0",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$color-heading",
              "content": "Number readiness: can each of your numbers text yet, and what is the one next step?",
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-largest",
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uZio9",
              "name": "Lead",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Shown on Phone & SMS, where your numbers live today. Owning a number, its paperwork and its texting approval are separate facts, so each number shows its own steps and one plain status: Business details needed, Under review, Action needed or Ready to text, plus the countries it can text. Research: GoHighLevel keeps numbers in Phone Numbers and texting approval in a separate Trust Center (Pending, Approved, Failed with the reason); Twilio's US texting registration (in progress, verified, failed) and toll-free check (pending, in review, approved, rejected with a reason, fixable and resent); Vercel's domain cards, which show each domain's status with the fix written right under it. Example: Road LTD in Burnaby, Canada, owns four numbers. Rename and Make default stay, as in the live app.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
