              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "A new concept. A summary at the top answers \"can I text yet?\" and lists what needs you. Every number then gets its own card: who it is, the four steps drawn as a little journey, and a coloured band at the bottom saying where it stands with the one button to press. Rename and Make default sit in each card's ⋯ menu. No panel to open; everything is on the card.",
