          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "m16iU",
              "name": "Eyebrow",
              "fill": "$color-interactive",
              "content": "COMMUNICATIONS · MESSENGER · PART 4 · FACEBOOK PAGES · APPROVED B BY JAFAR · 2026-10-23",
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-overline",
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "L542f",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$color-heading",
              "content": "Messenger: which Facebook Pages are connected, and are their messages reaching the inbox?",
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-largest",
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UO0W3",
              "name": "Lead",
              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1200,
              "content": "Settings → Communications → Messenger. A business logs in with Facebook, picks one or more Pages, then sends itself a test message to prove it works. Several Pages per business, one default. Each Page shows one plain status: Waiting for a test, Receiving, or Reconnect needed (Facebook ended access, permission removed, or Facebook paused delivery). Disconnecting keeps every old conversation. Research: GoHighLevel connects Pages under Settings → Integrations and asks you to test by messaging your Page; HubSpot and Zendesk list each connected Page with its status and a reconnect button. Example: Raad LTD in Burnaby has three Pages. Approved by Jafar 2026-10-23: Option B (hub with a live test panel); Option A (cards) removed. Pop-ups and states below approved by Jafar 2026-10-23.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": "$font-size-base",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
