              "content": "Team inbox box, like Intercom, Front and GoHighLevel. Reply / Internal comment tabs sit on its top edge; every tool lines up along its bottom with Send in words; Internal comment turns the whole box yellow and the button says Add comment. It keeps every live tool: channel switch, upload a file, files from the client, snippets, email templates (email), emoji, Send later (email), Minimize and Full screen, the From → To line and Subject for email, the text price (board nLAe4) and Ctrl+Enter to send. The Messenger reply window shows in words. The writing area starts three lines tall and grows as you type.",
